[["tk",.25+p/100*.75],["c1g",L>=1?.4+p/160:0],["c2g",L>=2?1:0],["c3g",L>=3?1:0]].forEach(a=>{const g=$("#"+a[0]);g.style.transform=`scale(${a[1]})`});
